B projects.info contains {"projects": [], "reserve": [], "extra": []}.
C The user starts the manager program.
D The new manager process starts the manager process M with FearlessCommandServe.
E M becomes a 'single candidate'.
F M ends with fatalError CorruptedManagerFolder, pointing at "extra" in projects.info.
G The new manager process ends.

